e_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397","id":1962367616,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85091qA","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-24T13:44:39Z","updated_at":"2024-02-24T16:33:36Z","body":"**ScanCode**\r\nidentifier: [asn1](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/asn1.LICENSE)\r\n\r\n**metaeffekt universe**\r\ncanonical name: [ASN.1 Object Dumping Code License](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[a]/README.md#user-content-asn.1-object-dumping-code-license:~:text=ASN%2E1%20Object%20Dumping%20Code%20License)\r\nshort identifier: ASN1 (we preserve original case; dots not allowed)\r\n\r\n**Others**\r\nThe ScanCode and metaeffekt short Id may be too underspecific. ASN.1 is a wider concept than just code dumping. Therefore, I'd recommend to use a short id that reflects this. E.g. ASN1-object-dumping-code","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962367616/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1998868850","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397#issuecomment-1998868850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397","id":1998868850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE853JFFy","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-15T03:20:56Z","updated_at":"2024-03-15T03:20:56Z","body":"+1 to add\r\n\r\nas for name/id - seems like @xsuchy suggestion is more specific than ASN1, which @karsten-klein has pointed out may be too underspecific. Would that work?\r\n\r\nI would also note that the license text is sort of buried in the midst of a bunch of background info, which Scancode includes as part of the license text. I think that @xsuchy has this right in terms of what is the license grant, but I'm wondering if we ought to include the other text and mark it as optional?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1998868850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2025248742","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397#issuecomment-2025248742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397","id":2025248742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE854ttfm","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-28T13:56:03Z","updated_at":"2024-03-28T13:56:03Z","body":"+1 to add\r\n\r\nI couldn't get the submitted URL (https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~pgut001/dumpasn1.c) to load at the moment, but looking at it from the [Wayback Machine](https://web.archive.org/web/20240106070707/https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~pgut001/dumpasn1.c), I would keep just that line that @xsuchy noted above.\r\n\r\nI'd note that this shows up at least as far back as [2002 in Debian mailing list discussions](https://lists.debian.org/debian-legal/2002/09/msg00030.html). Which points towards just that first sentence being the operative \"license\" language here.\r\n\r\nI see also that the same author has used that line (standing alone) in other code, see e.g. https://web.archive.org/web/20231019232554/https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~pgut001/pubs/breakms.c\r\n\r\nGiven that, perhaps `Gutmann` as ID and \"Gutmann License\" as name?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2025248742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2110787911","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397#issuecomment-2110787911","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397","id":2110787911,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8590BFH","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-14T17:43:34Z","updated_at":"2024-05-14T17:43:34Z","body":"to add, but need to decide on name and id","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2110787911/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2111402182","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397#issuecomment-2111402182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397","id":2111402182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8592XDG","user":{"login":"mkdolan","id":7398917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczOTg5MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7398917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan","html_url":"https://github.com/mkdolan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mkdolan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-15T01:07:13Z","updated_at":"2024-05-15T01:07:13Z","body":"> Given that, perhaps `Gutmann` as ID and \"Gutmann License\" as name?\r\n\r\nI hate to throw a wrinkle, and I see at least 1 other license on the list that already does what I'm about to say, but I would be hesitant to include a personal name in a public license list.\r\n\r\nHow about \"UseWhatever-ButNotClaim License\" and \"UWBNC\" as a identifier?\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2111402182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2119379442","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397#issuecomment-2119379442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2397","id":2119379442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85-Uyny","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-19T22:27:08Z","updated_at":"2024-05-19T22:27:08Z","body":"@mkdolan - we don't usually use names, but every so often it seems to make sense. There have been many submissions (from Fedora) that are old permissive licenses that don't have a proper title, so we have to come up with some kind of id (and not labor over i